  postHeader: 
  postContent: "After devoting equal column inches to a scholar and an internet troll,
    this piece leaves readers unsure which arguments rest on solid evidence\u2014and
    which are baseless.\n"
  funFact_Hint: Think whether both speakers deserve the same platform.
  BiasChoices:
  - <IsCorrectAnswer>k__BackingField: 1
    <Explanation>k__BackingField: It treats an expert and a troll as equally authoritative.
    <Choice>k__BackingField: 2
  - <IsCorrectAnswer>k__BackingField: 0
    <Explanation>k__BackingField: This is about giving two sides equal weight rather
      than choosing topics.
    <Choice>k__BackingField: 9
  - <IsCorrectAnswer>k__BackingField: 0
    <Explanation>k__BackingField: "Spin would tilt one view; here both are presented
      identically. \n"
    <Choice>k__BackingField: 6
  - <IsCorrectAnswer>k__BackingField: 0
    <Explanation>k__BackingField: "It\u2019s not excluding elites\u2014it\u2019s
      elevating an uninformed voice."
    <Choice>k__BackingField: 4
